OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died from head injury was 
OL,4,A'bubbly dad'                           
OL,6,FA man who died from a head injury      
OL,7,Fnearly two weeks after collapsing in a 
OL,8,Fcar park was a "bubbly dad" with not "a
OL,9,Fbad bone in his body", his family have 
OL,10,Fsaid.                                  
OL,12,FSteve Manifold, 35, was found in a car 
OL,13,Fpark on Kent Street, Preston, on 31    
OL,14,FAugust and died in hospital on 13      
OL,15,FSeptember.                             
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination found        
OL,18,FManifold, from Preston, died from "a   
OL,19,Fsignificant" head injury. Lancashire   
OL,20,FPolice said his death was being treated
OL,21,Fas suspicious and the investigation was
OL,22,Fongoing.                               
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
