OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died from head injury was 
OL,4,A'bubbly dad'                           
OL,6,FManifold's partner, Sherene said he was
OL,7,F"the life and soul of the party" and "a
OL,8,Fgenuinely nice guy".                   
